<title>ITALY: Italian August industrial output falls 11.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Italian August industrial output falls 11.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Statistics Institute ISTAT gave the following provisional figures for industrial production, year-on-year, in August.</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION	     Aug 96   July 96   Aug 95</p>
<p> Production index (unadjusted)     51.9    118.1     58.5</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct change (unadjusted)    -11.3    +4.1     +11.2</p>
<p> Mnth/mnth pct change (adjusted)   +0.5    -2.9	+7.1</p>
<p> Working days in month		   21     23	  22</p>
<p>ISTAT said seasonally adjusted data showed industrial out had fallen 8.2 percent year-on-year in August.</p>
<p>Note: (The industrial production index was rebased in January 1994 on 1990 levels, replacing a 1985-based index.)</p>
